Amazon DynamoDB is selected as the database due to its high availability and low latency performance, which are critical for real-time applications. It can automatically scale to handle varying workloads without manual intervention, ensuring that the bidding platform can accommodate spikes in traffic efficiently. The use of Amazon SQS and Amazon SNS facilitates reliable messaging between different components of the platform, ensuring that bids and notifications are processed in real-time without losing messages. Monitoring and observability are provided by Amazon CloudWatch, which enables the client to keep track of application performance and respond quickly to any issues that arise."
