      "reason": "AWS Fargate provides a serverless experience that eliminates the need to manage EC2 instances, simplifying the deployment process and allowing the team to focus on application development.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the team needs more control over the underlying infrastructure for optimization or specific compliance requirements, switching to EC2 may be beneficial."
