    "cost considerations": "The architecture is designed to minimize costs by using serverless components where possible, such as AWS Lambda and Kinesis, which only charge based on usage. Additionally, VPC Endpoints help reduce data transfer costs associated with accessing S3 and DynamoDB, while CloudFront can lower data transfer fees through its caching capabilities."
