    "reasoning": "Amazon CloudFront is the ideal choice for a CDN due to its global presence and ability to cache content at edge locations, significantly reducing latency for users accessing 4K video content. AWS Global Accelerator can further enhance performance by routing traffic to optimal endpoints based on health, geography, and routing policies. Using AWS Lambda allows for serverless processing of requests, which can help in dynamically generating content or handling video transcoding tasks as needed.\n\nStoring the 4K video content in Amazon S3 provides a highly durable and scalable storage solution, making it easy to serve large files to a global audience. Coupled with Amazon CloudFront, this architecture ensures reliable delivery of high-quality video content while minimizing costs associated with data transfer and storage. Amazon CloudWatch will be used to monitor the performance and health of the services involved, ensuring that any issues can be addressed promptly."
  },
  "trade_offs": [
    {
