      "chose": "Amazon S3",
      "reason": "Amazon S3 is more cost-effective for storing large amounts of static video content and offers better integration with CloudFront.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the application requires low-latency access to frequently changed data, Amazon EFS might be more suitable."
    },
    {
      "decision": "AWS Lambda vs Amazon EC2",
      "chose": "AWS Lambda",
      "reason": "AWS Lambda allows for automatic scaling and pay-as-you-go pricing, making it ideal for sporadic video processing tasks.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the video processing workload becomes predictable and resource-intensive, moving to Amazon EC2 could provide better performance."
