For the database layer, Amazon RDS with PostgreSQL is selected to provide a relational database that supports ACID transactions, ensuring data integrity. This is crucial for applications that require strong consistency. The integration of RDS with Lambda allows for easy data persistence while maintaining the event-driven architecture. Monitoring services like CloudWatch and X-Ray provide insights into application performance and help in debugging, ensuring reliability and maintainability of the system."
