    },
    {
      "decision": "Amazon SQS vs Amazon Kinesis",
      "chose": "Amazon SQS",
      "reason": "SQS is simpler to implement and manage for the use case of decoupling microservices with a low message rate of 50 messages per second. It provides reliable message delivery without the complexity of stream processing.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the message rate increases significantly or if real-time processing of streaming data becomes necessary, then Kinesis would be more appropriate."
    },
