  "terraform": "resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"subnet1\" {\n  vpc_id            = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block        = \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n  availability_zone = \"us-east-1a\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"subnet2\" {\n  vpc_id            = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block        = \"10.0.2.0/24\"\n  availability_zone = \"us-east-1b\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_security_group\" \"allow_http\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n  ingress {\n    from_port   = 80\n    to_port     = 80\n    protocol    = \"tcp\"\n    cidr_blocks = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_lb\" \"app_lb\" {\n  name               = \"app-lb\"\n  internal           = false\n  load_balancer_type = \"application\"\n  security_groups    = [aws_security_group.allow_http.id]\n  subnets            = [aws_subnet.subnet1.id, aws_subnet.subnet2.id]\n}\n\nresource \"aws_lambda_function\" \"ticket_function\" {\n  function_name = \"ticketLambda\"\n  runtime      = \"nodejs14.x\"\n  handler      = \"index.handler\"\n  role         = aws_iam_role.iam_for_lambda.arn\n  source_code_hash = filebase64sha256(\"function.zip\")\n}\n\nresource \"aws_dynamodb_table\" \"tickets\" {\n  name         = \"Tickets\"\n  billing_mode = \"PROVISIONED\"\n  read_capacity  = 25\n  write_capacity = 25\n  attribute {\n    name = \"ticketId\"\n    type = \"S\"\n  }\n  hash_key = \"ticketId\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_sns_topic\" \"ticket_topic\" {\n  name = \"ticketUpdates\"\n}",
  "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Request Ticket| ALB(Application Load Balancer)\n    ALB -->|Forward Request| Lambda(AWS Lambda)\n    Lambda -->|Check Availability| DynamoDB(Amazon DynamoDB)\n    DynamoDB -->|Update Status| Lambda\n    Lambda -->|Notify User| SNS(Amazon SNS)\n    SNS -->|Send Notification| User"
}

