      "decision": "Amazon API Gateway vs AWS App Runner for API management",
      "chose": "Amazon API Gateway",
      "reason": "API Gateway provides built-in support for managing APIs with features like throttling, caching, and security, which are beneficial for report generation APIs.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the application requires a fully managed service that handles containerized applications, App Runner could be considered."
    },
    {
      "decision": "Using CloudWatch vs EventBridge for scheduling",
      "chose": "EventBridge",
      "reason": "EventBridge provides more advanced scheduling capabilities and can easily integrate with other AWS services for event-driven architectures.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the scheduling needs become more complex or require integration with third-party services, EventBridge would be more suitable."
