      "decision": "Amazon API Gateway vs Elastic Load Balancing",
      "chose": "Amazon API Gateway",
      "reason": "Amazon API Gateway provides integrated support for RESTful APIs and is optimized for serverless architectures, simplifying the management of API traffic.",
