      "reason": "AWS Lambda is more cost-effective for low and sporadic workloads, as it charges only for the compute time consumed.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the application grows to require long-running processes, Amazon ECS may become a better fit due to its more predictable performance with dedicated resources."
    },
    {
