Using Amazon ECS with Fargate simplifies the deployment and scaling of containerized applications. Fargate abstracts the underlying infrastructure management, allowing the client to focus on application logic. The Application Load Balancer (ALB) will distribute incoming traffic across the ECS tasks, ensuring high availability and reliability. Amazon CloudFront can be used as a CDN to cache static content closer to users, further enhancing performance. Overall, this architecture is designed to be cost-effective while meeting the high-performance requirements of the client's workload."
