  "terraform": "resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"public_subnet\" {\n  vpc_id     = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n  map_public_ip_on_launch = true\n}\n\nresource \"aws_security_group\" \"allow_http\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n  ingress {\n    from_port   = 80\n    to_port     = 80\n    protocol    = \"tcp\"\n    cidr_blocks  = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_api_gateway_rest_api\" \"api\" {\n  name = \"RecommendationAPI\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_lambda_function\" \"recommendation_function\" {\n  function_name = \"RecommendationEngine\"\n  handler       = \"index.handler\"\n  runtime       = \"nodejs14.x\"\n  role          = aws_iam_role.lambda_exec.arn\n}\n\nresource \"aws_elasticache_cluster\" \"cache\" {\n  cluster_id = \"recommendation-cache\"\n  engine     = \"redis\"\n  node_type  = \"cache.t2.micro\"\n  num_cache_nodes = 1\n  subnet_group_name = aws_elasticache_subnet_group.default.name\n}\n\nresource \"aws_dynamodb_table\" \"recommendation_table\" {\n  name           = \"Recommendations\"\n  billing_mode   = \"PAY_PER_REQUEST\"\n  attribute {\n    name = \"UserId\"\n    type = \"S\"\n  }\n  key_schema {\n    attribute_name = \"UserId\"\n    key_type      = \"HASH\"\n  }\n}",
  "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Request| API_Gateway[API Gateway]\n    API_Gateway -->|Invoke| Lambda[AWS Lambda]\n    Lambda -->|Fetch| DynamoDB[Amazon DynamoDB]\n    Lambda -->|Cache| ElastiCache[Amazon ElastiCache]\n    Lambda -->|Send| SQS[Amazon SQS]\n    API_Gateway -->|Response| User\n    ElastiCache -->|Return Cache| Lambda\n"
}

