  "terraform": "resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"public\" {\n  vpc_id     = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n  map_public_ip_on_launch = true\n}\n\nresource \"aws_internet_gateway\" \"gw\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n}\n\nresource \"aws_api_gateway_rest_api\" \"api\" {\n  name = \"DocumentProcessingAPI\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_lambda_function\" \"pdf_processor\" {\n  function_name = \"PdfProcessor\"\n  handler = \"index.handler\"\n  runtime = \"nodejs14.x\"\n  role = aws_iam_role.lambda_exec.arn\n}\n\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"pdf_bucket\" {\n  bucket = \"pdf-storage-bucket\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_dynamodb_table\" \"metadata\" {\n  name         = \"PdfMetadata\"\n  billing_mode = \"PAY_PER_REQUEST\"\n  attribute {\n    name = \"id\"\n    type = \"S\"\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_sqs_queue\" \"pdf_queue\" {\n  name = \"PdfProcessingQueue\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_cloudwatch_log_group\" \"log_group\" {\n  name = \"/aws/lambda/PdfProcessor\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_iam_role\" \"lambda_exec\" {\n  name = \"lambda_exec_role\"\n  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({\n    Version = \"2012-10-17\"\n    Statement = [{\n      Action = \"sts:AssumeRole\"\n      Principal = {Service = \"lambda.amazonaws.com\"}\n      Effect = \"Allow\"\n      Sid = \"\"\n    }]\n  })\n}\n",
  "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Uploads PDF| APIGateway[Amazon API Gateway]\n    APIGateway -->|Triggers| Lambda[AWS Lambda]\n    Lambda -->|Stores| S3[Amazon S3]\n    Lambda -->|Stores Metadata| DynamoDB[Amazon DynamoDB]\n    Lambda -->|Sends Message| SQS[Amazon SQS]\n    SQS -->|Processes| ECS[Amazon ECS]\n    ECS -->|Logs to| CloudWatch[Amazon CloudWatch]"
