    "terraform": "resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_internet_gateway\" \"gw\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n}\n\nresource \"aws_security_group\" \"api_sg\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n}\n\nresource \"aws_security_group_rule\" \"allow_http\" {\n  type = \"ingress\"\n  from_port = 80\n  to_port = 80\n  protocol = \"tcp\"\n  security_group_id = aws_security_group.api_sg.id\n  cidr_blocks = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]\n}\n\nresource \"aws_lambda_function\" \"transcoder\" {\n  function_name = \"videoTranscoder\"\n  handler = \"index.handler\"\n  runtime = \"nodejs14.x\"\n  role = aws_iam_role.lambda_exec.arn\n}\n\nresource \"aws_api_gateway_rest_api\" \"api\" {\n  name = \"videoApi\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"video_bucket\" {\n  bucket = \"my-video-bucket\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_dynamodb_table\" \"video_metadata\" {\n  name = \"VideoMetadata\"\n  billing_mode = \"PAY_PER_REQUEST\"\n  attribute {\n    name = \"video_id\"\n    type = \"S\"\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_sqs_queue\" \"transcoding_queue\" {\n  name = \"transcodingQueue\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_cloudwatch_log_group\" \"log_group\" {\n  name = \"/aws/lambda/videoTranscoder\"\n}",
    "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Uploads Video| APIGateway([API Gateway])\n    APIGateway -->|Triggers| Lambda([AWS Lambda])\n    Lambda -->|Stores Video| S3([Amazon S3])\n    Lambda -->|Sends Message| SQS([Amazon SQS])\n    SQS -->|Triggers| ECS([Amazon ECS])\n    ECS -->|Processes Video| S3\n    S3 -->|Distributes Video| CloudFront([Amazon CloudFront])\n    CloudFront -->|Delivers Video| User"
