    AWS_Transit_Gateway --> Amazon_SageMaker_with_GPU_instances_e_g
    Amazon_SageMaker_with_GPU_instances_e_g --> Amazon_S3_for_data_storage
    Amazon_SageMaker_with_GPU_instances_e_g --> Amazon_RDS_for_metadata_management
    Amazon_SageMaker_with_GPU_instances_e_g --> Amazon_SQS_for_job_queueing
    Amazon_SageMaker_with_GPU_instances_e_g -->|metrics| Amazon_CloudWatch_for_logging_and_metrics
    Amazon_SageMaker_with_GPU_instances_e_g -->|metrics| AWS_X_Ray_for_tracing"
