    "reasoning": "Using Amazon CloudFront provides a globally distributed content delivery network, which reduces latency for users accessing the trading platform. By leveraging Amazon API Gateway, the architecture can handle the high volume of API calls with built-in support for throttling and monitoring, ensuring the APIs remain responsive and scalable. AWS Lambda is employed for its serverless nature, allowing automatic scaling based on demand, while Amazon ECS is used for containerized workloads that require persistent compute resources.\n\nFor database services, Amazon RDS is chosen for relational database needs, ensuring ACID compliance, which is critical for financial transactions. Amazon ElastiCache is incorporated to cache frequently accessed data, reducing database load and improving response times. Utilizing Amazon SNS for messaging ensures reliable communication between services, allowing for decoupled architecture and better fault tolerance. Monitoring with Amazon CloudWatch provides insights into the application performance, enabling proactive management of resources and costs.",
