  "terraform": "resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"public_subnet\" {\n  vpc_id     = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n  map_public_ip_on_launch = true\n}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"private_subnet\" {\n  vpc_id     = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block = \"10.0.2.0/24\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_security_group\" \"alb_sg\" {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n  ingress {\n    from_port   = 80\n    to_port     = 80\n    protocol    = \"tcp\"\n    cidr_blocks  = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]\n  }\n}\n\nresource \"aws_lb\" \"app_lb\" {\n  name               = \"app-lb\"\n  internal           = false\n  load_balancer_type = \"application\"\n  security_groups    = [aws_security_group.alb_sg.id]\n  subnets            = [aws_subnet.public_subnet.id]\n}\n\nresource \"aws_ecs_cluster\" \"ci_cd_cluster\" {\n  name = \"ci-cd-cluster\"\n}\n\nresource \"aws_ecs_task_definition\" \"ci_cd_task\" {\n  family                   = \"ci-cd-task\"\n  network_mode             = \"awsvpc\"\n  requires_compatibilities  = [\"FARGATE\"]\n  container_definitions = jsonencode([\n    {\n      name      = \"ci-cd-container\"\n      image     = \"your-image-uri\"\n      memory    = \"512\"\n      cpu       = \"256\"\n      essential = true\n    }\n  ])\n}\n\nresource \"aws_rds_instance\" \"default\" {\n  allocated_storage    = 20\n  engine             = \"postgres\"\n  engine_version     = \"12\"\n  instance_class     = \"db.t3.medium\"\n  identifier         = \"ci-cd-db\"\n  username           = \"admin\"\n  password           = \"your-password\"\n  db_name            = \"cidb\"\n  skip_final_snapshot = true\n}\n\nresource \"aws_dynamodb_table\" \"ci_cd_table\" {\n  name         = \"ci_cd_table\"\n  billing_mode = \"PAY_PER_REQUEST\"\n  attribute {\n    name = \"id\"\n    type = \"S\"\n  }\n  hash_key = \"id\"\n}\n",
  "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Commits Code| ALB[AWS Application Load Balancer]\n    ALB -->|Routes Requests| Fargate[AWS Fargate]\n    Fargate -->|Triggers Builds| SQS[Amazon SQS]\n    SQS -->|Notifies| SNS[Amazon SNS]\n    Fargate -->|Reads/Writes| DynamoDB[Amazon DynamoDB]\n    Fargate -->|Interacts with| RDS[Amazon RDS]\n    Fargate -->|Logs| CloudWatch[Amazon CloudWatch]\n    Fargate -->|Traces| XRay[AWS X-Ray]\n    CloudFront[Amazon CloudFront] --> ALB"
