      "decision": "VPC Peering vs AWS Transit Gateway",
      "chose": "AWS Transit Gateway",
      "reason": "Transit Gateway simplifies the management of multiple VPCs and on-premises networks, providing a single point of connectivity. This is beneficial for complex architectures with many microservices that need to communicate across different VPCs.",
