For data storage, Amazon DynamoDB is selected due to its fully managed nature and ability to scale seamlessly with demand. The integration of DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) provides in-memory caching to speed up read operations, which is crucial for mobile applications that require quick access to frequently used data. This architecture is designed to be cost-effective by leveraging serverless components and managed services, allowing the client to focus on application development rather than infrastructure management."
