Using AWS Lambda for any transformation or processing tasks during the migration allows for serverless execution, which can scale automatically based on the workload. Additionally, monitoring tools like Amazon CloudWatch and AWS X-Ray provide insights into the migration process, helping to identify bottlenecks and ensure that the migration is proceeding as planned. This architecture is designed to be cost-effective, leveraging managed services to reduce the need for manual intervention and maintenance."
