    "terraform": "resource \"aws_vpc\" \"main\" {  cidr_block = \"10.0.0.0/16\"  enable_dns_support = true  enable_dns_hostnames = true}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"public\" {  vpc_id     = aws_vpc.main.id  cidr_block = \"10.0.1.0/24\"  map_public_ip_on_launch = true}\n\nresource \"aws_subnet\" \"private\" {  vpc_id     = aws_vpc.main.id  cidr_block = \"10.0.2.0/24\"}\n\nresource \"aws_internet_gateway\" \"gw\" {  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id}\n\nresource \"aws_route_table\" \"public\" {  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id  route {    cidr_block = \"0.0.0.0/0\"    gateway_id = aws_internet_gateway.gw.id  }}\n\nresource \"aws_route_table_association\" \"public_association\" {  subnet_id      = aws_subnet.public.id  route_table_id = aws_route_table.public.id}\n\nresource \"aws_security_group\" \"web_sg\" {  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id  ingress {    from_port   = 80    to_port     = 80    protocol    = \"tcp\"    cidr_blocks = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]  }  egress {    from_port   = 0    to_port     = 0    protocol    = \"-1\"    cidr_blocks = [\"0.0.0.0/0\"]  }}\n\nresource \"aws_api_gateway_rest_api\" \"api\" {  name = \"OnlineLearningAPI\"}\n\nresource \"aws_lambda_function\" \"handler\" {  function_name = \"HandlerFunction\"  handler = \"index.handler\"  runtime = \"nodejs14.x\"  role = aws_iam_role.lambda_exec.arn}\n\nresource \"aws_ecs_cluster\" \"cluster\" {  name = \"learning-cluster\"}\n\nresource \"aws_rds_instance\" \"db\" {  engine = \"mysql\"  instance_class = \"db.t3.micro\"  allocated_storage = 20  name = \"learningdb\"  username = \"admin\"  password = \"password\"  vpc_security_group_ids = [aws_security_group.web_sg.id]}\n\nresource \"aws_dynamodb_table\" \"table\" {  name       = \"UserContent\"  billing_mode = \"PAY_PER_REQUEST\"  attribute {    name = \"UserId\"    type = \"S\"  }}\n\nresource \"aws_sqs_queue\" \"queue\" {  name = \"learning-queue\"}\n\nresource \"aws_cloudwatch_log_group\" \"log_group\" {  name = \"/aws/lambda/HandlerFunction\"}",
    "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Requests| API[API Gateway]\n    API -->|Triggers| Lambda[AWS Lambda]\n    API -->|Routes| ELB[Elastic Load Balancer]\n    ELB -->|Distributes| ECS[Amazon ECS]\n    ECS -->|Reads/Writes| RDS[Amazon RDS]\n    ECS -->|Stores| DynamoDB[Amazon DynamoDB]\n    ECS -->|Sends| SQS[Amazon SQS]\n    Lambda -->|Logs| CloudWatch[CloudWatch]\n    API -->|Caches| CF[Amazon CloudFront]"
  }
