For data storage, Amazon RDS provides a managed relational database solution that simplifies database management tasks such as backups and scaling. Utilizing security groups and Network Access Control Lists (NACLs) allows for fine-grained control over inbound and outbound traffic, ensuring that only necessary communication occurs between services. This micro-segmentation approach minimizes the attack surface and adheres to the principle of least privilege, enhancing the overall security posture of the architecture."
