    Amazon_Application_Load_Balancer --> Amazon_RDS_for_PostgreSQL_with_read_replicas
    Amazon_Application_Load_Balancer --> Amazon_ECS_for_application_services
    Amazon_RDS_for_PostgreSQL_with_read_replicas --> Amazon_RDS_for_PostgreSQL
    Amazon_ECS_for_application_services --> Amazon_RDS_for_PostgreSQL
    Amazon_RDS_for_PostgreSQL_with_read_replicas --> Amazon_SQS_for_asynchronous_processing
