    "reasoning": "For this real-time bidding platform, scalability is crucial due to the variable volume of bids processed. AWS Lambda offers a serverless compute option that automatically scales to handle bursts of traffic, while Amazon ECS provides a container orchestration solution suitable for microservices architecture. The use of Amazon CloudFront ensures low latency and high transfer speeds for users globally, while also adding a layer of security through its built-in DDoS protection.\n\nFor data storage, Amazon DynamoDB is chosen for its ability to handle high read and write throughput, which is essential for real-time bidding. Amazon RDS is included for transactional data processing, ensuring ACID compliance. To facilitate communication between components, Amazon SQS and Amazon SNS are utilized for decoupled message processing, enhancing reliability. The architecture includes monitoring solutions like Amazon CloudWatch and AWS X-Ray for real-time insights and troubleshooting capabilities, ensuring that the system remains reliable and performant under varying loads.",
