    "diagram": "graph TD\n    User([User])\n    User -->|Requests Ride| API[API Gateway]\n    API -->|Triggers| Lambda[AWS Lambda]\n    Lambda -->|Reads/Writes| DBDynamoDB[Amazon DynamoDB]\n    Lambda -->|Queries| RDS[Amazon RDS]\n    Lambda -->|Sends Messages| SQS[Amazon SQS]\n    ALB[Application Load Balancer] -->|Routes Traffic| ECS[Amazon ECS]\n    ECS -->|Serves Requests| User"
  },
