For networking, Amazon API Gateway provides a robust way to manage and secure access to the Lambda functions while AWS App Mesh can be utilized for service discovery and traffic management if microservices are involved. Using Amazon CloudFront as an edge service allows for caching and faster content delivery, enhancing user experience. Monitoring with Amazon CloudWatch and AWS X-Ray ensures that we can observe performance metrics and trace requests through the architecture, enabling proactive management and optimization."
