Incorporating Amazon CloudFront as an edge service can further optimize performance by caching frequently accessed data, reducing latency for end-users. Monitoring with Amazon CloudWatch and AWS X-Ray provides insights into application performance and database metrics, allowing for proactive management of resources and quick identification of bottlenecks. This combination of services ensures a robust, scalable, and cost-effective architecture that can adapt to varying workloads."
