      "chose": "SQS",
      "reason": "SQS provides a reliable message queuing service that decouples the services and ensures that messages are processed in order, which is essential for preventing thundering herd issues.",
      "when_to_switch": "If the application needs to push notifications to multiple subscribers simultaneously, SNS would be more suitable."
