        "reason": "S3 is cost-effective and highly durable for storing large datasets like 100GB CSV files. It also integrates seamlessly with other AWS services for data processing and analytics.",
        "when_to_switch": "If the workload requires low-latency access to frequently accessed files or needs a file system interface, Amazon EFS may be more suitable."
      }
    ]
  },
  "trade_offs": [],
