For data storage, Amazon RDS is chosen for relational database needs, ensuring high availability and automated backups, while Amazon ElastiCache is used for caching to enhance performance. Messaging services like Amazon SNS and SQS facilitate decoupled communication between microservices. Finally, monitoring is achieved through Amazon CloudWatch for metrics and logs, AWS X-Ray for distributed tracing, and AWS CloudTrail for auditing API calls, ensuring a robust observability framework that aligns with best practices for reliability and performance."
