For messaging, Amazon Kinesis Data Streams is utilized to handle the real-time ingestion of metrics data from the application. Kinesis allows for high-throughput data streaming and can retain data for a configurable period, making it ideal for processing metrics in near real-time. The architecture is designed to be cost-effective by leveraging serverless services, which means the client only pays for what they use, reducing idle resource costs. Finally, Amazon CloudWatch is integrated for monitoring and visualizing the metrics, providing a seamless way to track application performance and health."
