The architecture is designed to be scalable, as both S3 Glacier and S3 can handle virtually unlimited amounts of data. The use of CloudFront provides a global content delivery network that enhances retrieval performance and reduces latency for end-users. Additionally, the integration of Amazon SNS allows for notifications when data retrieval requests are completed, improving the user experience. Overall, this architecture balances cost, performance, and compliance needs effectively."
