    Amazon_EMR_for_big_data_processing --> Amazon_S3_for_storage
    Amazon_EMR_for_big_data_processing --> AWS_Glue_Data_Catalog_for_metadata_management
    AWS_Lambda_for_serverless_transformations --> Amazon_S3_for_storage
