        "reason": "AWS Lambda is ideal for event-driven architectures and scales automatically, making it suitable for handling bursts of traffic without provisioning servers.",
        "when_to_switch": "If the application requires long-running processes or specific runtime environments, Amazon ECS would be a better fit."
