      {
        "decision": "Amazon Aurora vs Amazon DynamoDB",
        "chose": "Amazon Aurora",
        "reason": "Amazon Aurora provides strong consistency and supports complex queries, which are beneficial for transactional operations in banking.",
        "when_to_switch": "For high-velocity, simple key-value access patterns with minimal transactions, Amazon DynamoDB would be more cost-effective."
