        "chose": "Application Load Balancer",
        "reason": "Application Load Balancer supports HTTP/2 and WebSocket protocols, which are critical for real-time communication in a mobile banking app.",
        "when_to_switch": "If the application requires extreme performance and low latency for TCP traffic, a Network Load Balancer would be more appropriate."
      }
    ],
    "cost": {
