Networking is designed with AWS Transit Gateway to create a hub-and-spoke topology, simplifying connectivity between multiple VPCs if needed, while ensuring high availability and reliability. The use of Amazon S3 for data storage provides a scalable and cost-effective solution for handling large datasets generated during simulations. Amazon EFS can be utilized for shared file systems, allowing multiple instances to access the same data concurrently, which is crucial for HPC workloads. Monitoring with Amazon CloudWatch ensures that resource utilization is tracked and optimized continuously."
