    },
    {
      "decision": "Amazon Kinesis vs Amazon SQS",
      "chose": "Amazon Kinesis",
      "reason": "Amazon Kinesis offers real-time data streaming capabilities, making it suitable for processing and analyzing score updates as they happen.",
